    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is easy and relaxing to play, requiring only mouse control, making it suitable for both casual and challenging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to swing your sword and release sword energy, precisely slashing enemies. When the energy bar is full, right-click to unleash a powerful ultimate skill to sweep the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the endless waves of skeleton soldiers, collect coins, and unlock 10 unique sword wave skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the relentless onslaught of skeleton hordes from all directions, experiencing thrilling hack-and-slash combat and intense battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for a casual experience or an extreme challenge, this game will deliver an exhilarating combat adventure!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is easy and relaxing to play, requiring only mouse control, making it suitable for both casual and challenging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to swing your sword and release sword energy, precisely slashing enemies. When the energy bar is full, right-click to unleash a powerful ultimate skill to sweep the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the endless waves of skeleton soldiers, collect coins, and unlock 10 unique sword wave skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the relentless onslaught of skeleton hordes from all directions, experiencing thrilling hack-and-slash combat and intense battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for a casual experience or an extreme challenge, this game will deliver an exhilarating combat adventure!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a top-down survival shooter game where players must fight for survival on a battlefield filled with skeleton soldiers.",
